  "bodyHash": "zCt8m+1yw9g=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>真實火把</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2517826-realistic-torches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 論壇</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>真實火把模組透過使火把在可設定的時間後熄滅，增加早期遊戲難度，鼓勵玩家盡早轉向使用永久性光源。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><strong>特色功能</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>火把合成後為未點燃狀態，需使用火柴盒或打火石點燃</li>\n<li>火將在可設定的時間後熄滅（預設為現實時間60分鐘）</li>\n<li>火把遇雨會熄滅</li>\n<li>原版結構中生成的火把會被替換為未點燃狀態</li>\n<li>可使用螢光石製作永久發光的火把</li>\n<li>自然發光方塊與物品在手持時會發出光源（適用1.14.4之前版本）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong><strong>合成配方</strong></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/oQWLX8N.png\" alt=\"未點燃火把（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"376\" height=\"180\"></p><p><em>未點燃火把（煤炭或木炭）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z0BxMQU.png\" alt=\"火柴盒\" width=\"378\" height=\"181\"></p><p><em>火柴盒</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2FHuHQi.png\" alt=\"點燃火把（無序合成，火柴盒會耗損）\" width=\"379\" height=\"181\"></p><p><em>點燃火把（無序合成，火柴盒會耗損）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tcowSUW.png\" alt=\"螢光石晶體（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"379\" height=\"182\"></em></p><p><em>螢光石晶體（煤炭或木炭）</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nt6fTDz.png\" alt=\"螢光石糊（無序合成）\" width=\"380\" height=\"213\"></em></p><p><em>螢光石糊（無序合成）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vpSV7pX.png\" alt=\"原版火把（螢光石晶體）\" width=\"379\" height=\"180\"></em></p><p><em>原版火把（螢光石晶體）<br></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/otOc8ue.png\" alt=\"原版火把（螢光石糊）\" width=\"381\" height=\"214\"></em></p><p><em><em>原版火把（螢光石糊）</em><br></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\">模組包使用</span></strong></p><p>本模組可自由應用於各類模組包中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援專案</strong></span></p><p>若您喜歡本模組並願意支持開發，歡迎透過<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRealistic%2bTorches%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal捐贈</a>，您的支持將是開發的重要動力！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>贊助商</strong></span></p><p>本專案由BisectHosting贊助。若需伺服器託管服務，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">請參考其託管方案</a>，結帳時使用優惠碼&nbsp;<em>Chaos</em>&nbsp;可享首月25%折扣！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
